[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11521.469, "timestamp": "03:12:01", "text": "对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11524.389, "timestamp": "03:12:04", "text": "我不知道。我不知道，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11527.19, "timestamp": "03:12:07", "text": "这太过分了。是啊，太过了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11529.59, "timestamp": "03:12:09", "text": "很多。我知道像 YouTuber 那样的人会付钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11532.11, "timestamp": "03:12:12", "text": "他们的模型和其他东西花了不少钱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11535.269, "timestamp": "03:12:15", "text": "但这样还是有点太过了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11539.19, "timestamp": "03:12:19", "text": "很多。是的。我意识到有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11542.469, "timestamp": "03:12:22", "text": "这也会带来一些并发症，就像曾经一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11544.55, "timestamp": "03:12:24", "text": "事情已经办完了，对吧？这件艺术品是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11546.87, "timestamp": "03:12:26", "text": "完毕。呃，你看到的这个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11549.51, "timestamp": "03:12:29", "text": "最新的一个。嗯，是的，最初的那个是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11552.07, "timestamp": "03:12:32", "text": "类似，但并不完全一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11555.11, "timestamp": "03:12:35", "text": "分开了。所以，这很难做到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11557.03, "timestamp": "03:12:37", "text": "可装配之类的东西。所以这就是我的原因"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11559.03, "timestamp": "03:12:39", "text": "做不出轮廓，而且喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11561.67, "timestamp": "03:12:41", "text": "在拍摄过程中稍微挑逗一下模特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11563.389, "timestamp": "03:12:43", "text": "这位乔森"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11566.15, "timestamp": "03:12:46", "text": "事件。我当时在想，其实我考虑过……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11569.03, "timestamp": "03:12:49", "text": "实际上，我是在购买该许可证。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11573.91, "timestamp": "03:12:53", "text": "我必须支付这么多钱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11577.269, "timestamp": "03:12:57", "text": "一年。呃，所以我可以，我被允许喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11579.59, "timestamp": "03:12:59", "text": "推广内容，用一切来制作内容"}]